From 825ff12caece67355f1fb1c63e8d1e78b72415ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 14:48:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] F-195: Zeppelin patch set on current upstream wxl-core

llvm-mingw Linux cross-compile port (mingw-compat d3d9on12.h, CMakeLists),
On12 opt-in + asset-pipeline opt-out gating (Proxy/Main), terrain-swap Lua
bridge (PhasingHooks + offsets/Script.hpp, F-194/F-196), RenderHooks SEH
restructure, MpqStore. Rebased onto upstream (adt runtime moved to module).

